[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=18 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="外堤的铃响起来以后，民居没有像你以为的那样一下空掉。有人找钥匙，有人捆被子，有人坚持要先把自家门口的木板卸下来，说下次回来就没了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="不拿能替换的家具，拿药、证件和保暖的东西。家里还有人的，到桥边报一声，别一个人往回跑。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="他们不相信会有危险？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="有些人很相信。就是已经走过太多次，每次回来少一点东西，慢慢就不知道哪一次该真走了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="一个老妇人抱着一只很大的空相框，不肯上船。相框里面没有照片，你差点说这是可以留下的东西，德雷顿先问她照片是不是放在口袋里。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="老妇人"

text="没有。以前的照片不防水，早没了。架子摆着，屋里就还像有人。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="德雷顿看了一眼船上的空位，让她把相框平放在膝上。她没有告诉你这样会耽误多少时间，只低声说，别先替别人判断什么算能换的。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="可船要是装不下呢？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="那就我们少带一只空桶。真到装不下的时候，再把这个问题摊开说，不要抢在它发生前先把人丢回去。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="前面的撤离水道还畅通，后面有接触在靠近。按序走，不用追着每个落下的物件转弯。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你在名单上划掉已经上船的人。名字里有几个读不出，你抬头问，他们就又说一遍。最开始每次问都会心虚，后来发现没人介意名字被好好确认。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="小队护住队尾，先把他们送到内侧泊位。进泊位才算到，不是在海图上越过一条线就放手。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="如果我听见仓库那边的频道呢？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="先报，继续当前目标。不要因为有人叫你的名字，就自己把负责的人放下。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你点头，把收音机的记录交给帕金斯保管。德雷顿问相框的角会不会碰到前排的人，老妇人把它转了一个方向，挤出一点地方让一个小孩坐下。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

